  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The latest VRChat update (2/2/2023) seems to have broke the VRC Animator Tracking Control component's functionality with index controllers (I suspect it's related to the portion of the update that improved quest finger tracking?). You can no longer override index finger tracking via that component. Your fingers now always track, 100% of the time. This affects grip animations for props, things like custom peace signs/thumbs up/etc. that many Booth avatars come with. Please restore the functionality of this component with Index controllers.",
